            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Schedules

- Fixed scheduled blocks that stayed on after their end time instead of
  lifting.

### Website Blocker

- Typing in Chrome's address bar no longer blocks a site that autocomplete
  suggests before you press Enter.
- The block page now shows the right site when two blocks happen back to
  back.

### Uninstall Protection

- The emergency code screen now has a close button and matches the PIN
  screen.

### Updates

- Updates are now delivered from Kahf servers.
]]></description>
